 " is the total population size, ",
 StyleBox["s",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " is the number of susceptible individuals, ",
 StyleBox["\[Iota]  ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "is the number of infected individuals, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["r", "A"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4e6169d9-c691-4b25-a785-abf19325de59"],
 " is the number of seropositive  and recovered individuals, and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["r", "T"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a2ccb8f4-df33-472b-ae52-d679a175d1ce"],
 " is the number of seronegative and recovered individuals."
}], "Text",
